                    insight_benchmark:      `Belonging for newer members has reached the company benchmark of ~3.9 — the gap between core and newcomers has effectively closed. That is what changed practice looks like.`,

                    hint_tokenism:          `A move you made risks tokenism — it performs diversity without redistributing voice. Favour structural change (how meetings run, where decisions are made) over anything that puts people on display.`,
                    hint_safety:            `Psychological safety is dangerously low. Model it yourself — invite dissent, amplify quiet voices, admit fallibility — and never correct anyone by public humiliation.`,
